WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.126
Dude! That house is giving away

00:00:01.126 --> 00:00:02.585
full sized candy bars.

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:04.462
That house forgave my student loan debt.

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:06.423
What the hell kind of street is this?

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:10.927
I'll give you the rest when you retire.

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:11.928
Are you a real woman?

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:13.179
Did you get the student loan thing?

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:13.763
Kind of.

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:14.806
They said the house on the right

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:16.182
made them stop using the front door,

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.600
so I had to go to the back door.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.143
Oh.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.019
And I only got 10K

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:19.686
because I don't work

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:20.520
in the public sector.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.439
Well the house on the right gave me an AR15.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.565
Holy crap.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.442
But they made me burned my library card.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:26.651
Something about drag queens?

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:27.777
That old guy on the left

00:00:27.777 --> 00:00:29.320
makes you sit through DEI training

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.488
and then takes half your candy

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.614
if he thinks you have too much.

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:33.199
Doesn't that guy own like three houses?

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:33.533
Yeah.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.784
And all his candy has stickers

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:36.077
that say “it may cause cancer.”

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:36.786
That guy on the right

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:37.704
took away my Mike and Ike’s.

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:39.205
These things are a slippery slope

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:40.290
to  Three Musketeers.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.624
I've seen a ton of Airheads

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:42.584
and Dum Dums.

00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:43.752
On the far left there's a huge 

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:44.753
horror show going on.

00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:45.628
On the right too but,

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:46.629
those guys are having trouble

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:47.380
with their speaker.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.549
Every new one's the worse than the last!

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.967
That red house only gives out candy

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:52.218
if you pass a drug test.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.303
Oh wait, did you get drugs? 

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:54.095
Not good ones.

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:55.138
But the one on the far left

00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:56.306
gave me hormone blockers.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.891
What about that yellow house with the snake flag

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.017
 they’re into drugs, right?

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:00.769
It sounds like they were fighting inside.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:02.437
You don't belong in this house.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:03.772
It’s not your house, it’s my house!

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:04.856
I have the keys.

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:05.982
You took the keys!

00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.276
Why is no one giving out drugs?

00:01:08.276 --> 00:01:09.944
The news said we’d get drugs.

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:10.904
Maybe people enjoy

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.238
taking drugs more than they enjoy

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.114
giving them to children.

00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:14.324
Did you hit that little pink house?

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:15.366
Somebody did.

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:17.077
All right, just don't go too far left.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:17.619
The rumor is

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:18.495
they're forcing every kid

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:19.496
to dump out their bags

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:20.663
so they can redistribute

00:01:20.663 --> 00:01:21.956
all the candy equally.

00:01:21.956 --> 00:01:23.541
Well, that doesn't seem so terrible.

00:01:23.541 --> 00:01:24.834
They say the same thing every year

00:01:24.834 --> 00:01:25.376
and in the end,

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:26.252
they murder the kids

00:01:26.252 --> 00:01:27.879
with too much candy or education,

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:29.255
and eventually everyone starves.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.965
I don't know why kids keep going there.

00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:32.342
Well, maybe this year it'll be different?

00:01:32.342 --> 00:01:34.094
The kids are always dead by summer.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.553
I bet they just sent those kids to camp.

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:36.387
I mean  you're wrong,

00:01:36.387 --> 00:01:38.598
but you're also not wrong.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:40.600
Oh, yeah. I get it now.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.893
What's your position on abortion?

00:01:41.893 --> 00:01:42.644
You can take as many

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:43.853
as there are genders.

00:01:43.853 --> 00:01:44.729
Just stick to the middle.

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:46.106
I already got a stimulus check,

00:01:46.106 --> 00:01:48.441
sugar subsidies, a sports stadium.

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:49.776
That house even gives you cash

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.277
if you promise not to grow any corn!

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.987
I heard the Menendez house had gold bars,

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:53.780
but they're not answering

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.614
the door anymore.

00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:55.573
Oh, hey, it’s that foreign

00:01:55.573 --> 00:01:56.366
exchange student.

00:01:56.366 --> 00:01:57.867
What's your haul look like, Zelenskyy?

00:01:57.867 --> 00:02:00.370
75 billion. But the night is young!

00:02:01.538 --> 00:02:02.997
75 billion?

00:02:02.997 --> 00:02:04.541
It's how neighborhoods compete now.

00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:05.708
It's like a proxy Halloween.

